{"id":8859695907015,"title":"Personalized Colorful Desert RV Sunset Scene Quilt Sets - Style #9","handle":"personalized-colorful-desert-rv-sunset-scene-quilt-sets-style-9","description":"\u003cp\u003eWelcome vibrant nature into your home with the Jeminise Desert Cactus Printed Quilt Set. This stunning quilt set, featuring lively cacti and floral designs in bold colors, is perfect for adding a touch of nature-inspired beauty and warmth to any bedroom or living space. It's an ideal choice for refreshing your home decor and makes a thoughtful gift for nature lovers or those who appreciate cheerful bedding.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVibrant Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Features a lively array of cacti and flowers in rich, bold colors, perfect for a nature-inspired or desert-themed room.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt by selecting your preferred size or adding pillowcases, with options to include a name.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Offered in multiple sizes including Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68\"x86\"), Full (80\"x90\"), Queen (90\"x90\"), and King (102\"x91\") to fit various beds.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift:\u003c\/strong\u003e A unique and thoughtful gift idea for cactus lovers, home decor enthusiasts, or anyone who appreciates vibrant bedding, suitable for various occasions.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e Designed for convenience, this quilt set is machine washable for simple cleaning and low-maintenance upkeep.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eVersatile Use:\u003c\/strong\u003e Can be used as a bed quilt, picnic mat, or a throw blanket, suitable for beds, sofas, backyard, or camping, offering consecutive warmth in all seasons.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eQuality Material:\u003c\/strong\u003e The outer layer is made of breathable soft fabric, and the filling material is high-quality silk floss for comfortable use.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eJeminise\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eProduct Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eQuilt Set\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eMaterial\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolycotton\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eFabric Type\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003ePolycotton\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eIncluded Components\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 Quilt + 2 Pillowcase (Optional)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eColor\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eStyle #1\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eStyle\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eSouthwestern Style\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eTheme\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCactus, Desert\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003ePattern\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eCactus, Flowers\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCustomization\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003e1 text input\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eAvailable Sizes\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eThrow (60x70 inches), Twin (68x86 inches), Full(80x90 inches), Queen (90x90 inches), King (91x102 inches)\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eCare Instructions\u003c\/th\u003e\n\u003ctd\u003eMachine Wash\u003c\/td\u003e\n\u003c\/tr\u003e\n\u003c\/tbody\u003e\u003c\/table\u003e","published_at":"2026-08-12T15:45:31-05:00","created_at":"2026-08-12T15:38:32-05:00","v